{"id": "704129ee-5ebc-4c58-a595-bd676eed8f9e", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T12:20:27.037019", "source": "user", "parent_id": "1ebb26e5-e52a-4f7a-b1e7-d61a6bb14c12", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{\"researcher_request\": \"初始检查阶段：请按以下顺序提供三项内容，仍属设计层面，不必实际运行实验。运行环境已禁用网络，请基于仓库本地可用内容作答。所需三件事如下： (1) 仓库与文档检查 — 查阅JaxMARL库中MPE Simple Spread的实现：默认智能体数量、观测/动作维度、终止/截断条件、API形态（gym/PettingZoo风格还是JaxMARL自有MPE wrapper）、是否原生JIT、是否使用vmap/scanned循环；同样查阅PettingZoo中MPE Simple Spread（mpe_v2/pettingzoo.mpe.simple_spread）的实现细节：默认智能体数量、并行API vs AEC API、底层物理求解器、step调用开销。若运行环境未预装JaxMARL或PettingZoo，仅依据仓库自带文档/源码做说明，并明确说明哪些需在外部环境核对。 (2) 拟议实验方法 — 仅设计，不必执行。需涵盖：两侧加载Simple Spread的等价方式；随机动作采样策略（作用于联合动作空间，每智能体均匀）；步骤-每秒（SPS）的精确定义（agent-step vs environment-step，需明确以何为准）；预热阶段（剔除JIT首次编译与缓存分配）、正式测量时长、重复次数、汇总统计量（均值、中位数、置信区间）；对照项（相同智能体数N、相同episode长度T、相同随机种子、可复现的随机动作序列，或各自独立随机）；JAX侧的批处理策略（vmap并行环境实例数）与CPU-GPU数据传输测量是否纳入；CPU侧对单线程与多线程均应给出对照方案。 (3) 关键假设与不确定性 — 列出影响结论效度的所有假设与未知项，至少涵盖：Simple Spread在JaxMARL与PettingZoo中的实现是否同构（智能体数、地标数、运动学与奖励）；JaxMARL Simple Spread在CPU-only环境下的可比性（GPU_enabled=false约束下，何谓“GPU加速”）；随机动作是否触发了不同代码路径；版本差异（JAX/PettingZoo/SuperSuit版本钉定）；JIT副作用与asynchronous dispatch对SPS计时的偏差；CPU亲和性py pinning（cpu_affinity_count=24）如何影响PettingZoo侧 BLS。请不要请求最终设计稿或执行实验。\", \"required_handoff_stage\": \"plan\", \"approach_approved\": false, \"public_task\": {\"question\": \"How does the performance of JaxMARL in the MPE Simple Spread environment compare to its original CPU-based counterpart in terms of steps-per-second under random actions?\", \"context\": \"Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.\", \"environment\": {\"runtime\": \"bubblewrap\", \"network\": \"disabled\", \"repository\": \"/workspace\", \"python\": \"python3\", \"software_environment\": \"system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled\", \"datasets\": [], \"gpu_enabled\": false, \"cpu_affinity_count\": 24, \"note\": \"Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment.\"}, \"researcher_topics\": [\"neurips2024/97649/2:setup_4\", \"neurips2024/97649/2:setup_5\", \"neurips2024/97649/2:setup_9\"], \"question_budget\": 6, \"actor_step_budget\": 60, \"continue_after_initial_plan\": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "kind": "MessageEvent", "source_event_index": 1}
